00:13:27.033 --> 00:13:27.866
Apakah kau mendengarnya?

00:13:29.491 --> 00:13:30.200
Tidak.

00:13:33.116 --> 00:13:34.533
Dia menangis. Dengar.

00:13:36.325 --> 00:13:37.908
